the series is set in the year 2149 when  the Earth's ability to support life is  reaching its end as oxygen is depleting  day by day due to over development  people are having difficulties breathing  so they are forced to wear specialized  masks moreover the world has become so  polluted that the plants can no longer  grow and fruits are considered rare to  keep things strictly under control a  military-like law enforcement system has  been imposed they have adopted a  two-child policy to combat the  overpopulation issue on the other hand  the scientists have also achieved a  breakthrough they have discovered a tear  in the fabric of space-time which leads  them to Terra Nova the prehistoric Earth  of 85 million years ago in other words  the scientists have found a time portal  that can teleport them to the Cretaceous  Period where the world is still green  and dinosaurs are still active  [Music]  foreign  at the start of the series Jim Shannon a  cop by profession enters his residence  wearing a rebreather which is an oxygen  mask to support airflow Jim lives with  his wife Elizabeth a medical officer and  three children Josh Maddie and Zoe in  this way despite being a cop himself he  has violated the two-child policy soon  he takes out an orange from his bag and  the entire family is very surprised  since fruit and vegetables are in short  supply as the family is having a good  time with the orange what does that mean  Maddie suddenly enters the apartment and  warns them that she saw the population  control police in the lobby this alarmed  the parents and they quickly hide little  Zoe in an air vent shortly after the  police come in and start rummaging  through the place it appears as if  someone informed them about the third  child at least if they find her her  final memory will be going nuts with  that orange they search everywhere but  fail to find the little girl however  just as they're about to leave a scared  Zoe whimpers from the vent and gets  discovered devastated Jim begs the cops  to release his daughter and even starts  fighting them however he is easily  outnumbered and taken into custody  himself for his offense he's handed over  an eight-year sentence two years later  Elizabeth tips off a prison guard and  finally manages to visit her husband Jim  is sick in his cell due to poor air  quality and the lack of a rebreather as  the two reconcile Elizabeth reveals that  she has been given a position as a  medical officer in the 10th pilgrimage  but she is not allowed to take Zoe the  10th pilgrimage is the tenth group of  human colonists who will be allowed to  travel to Terra Nova where they can  start a new life before leaving she  tells Jim that he is their last hope and  sneaks in a rebreather after a while Jim  checks the rebreather and finds a hidden  laser knife inside hot damn in the next  scene Elizabeth Maddie and Josh check in  go through security and head towards the  time portal on the other hand Jim  manages to get out of the prison with  the help of the laser knife and arrives  at the check-in area he slides into a  restricted room where he pays a large  amount of money in exchange for a  certain bag unfortunately the officers  notice him on camera breaching the  restricted area by this time Elizabeth  and the children have already walked in  through the portal but when Jim tries to  follow them an officer stops him since  the time portal is irreversible anyone  who reaches Terra Nova cannot return Jim  knows about this so he elbows the  officer steals his gun and runs into the  portal to follow his family as soon as  he enters the portal he reaches the  prehistoric Earth which is completely  different from the world they just  laughed Jim finally reunites with his  family but when a soldier notices the  weapon in his hand he is held at  gunpoint the soldier then checks the  suspicious bag that Jim is carrying  unsurprisingly little Zoe comes out of  it seeing the entire family together the  soldiers leave them be what you're doing  is all kinds of illegal but God damn it  you made it to Dinosaur World so have a  good day later as the group proceeds  towards Terra Nova little Zoe comments  on the sky she notes that she had never  seen the clouds so wide and the trees so  green after entering Terra Nova for the  first time The Travelers of the 10th  pilgrimage are greeted by Commander  Nathaniel Taylor one of the first people  to enter the travel portal he gives a  short introduction of the place and  assures that everyone is going to have a  better life from today onwards so long  as they don't get their asses ripped off  by dinosaurs following this he confronts  Jim and Elizabeth and berates them for  breaking the law however when the couple  pleads for a fresh start he lets them  keep their three children Jim wants to  stay a cop in Terra Nova as well but  given his history Taylor assigns him to  the agricultural Department next the  family settles into their new home  Maddie and Zoe fight for their new rooms  while their parents contemplate if they  made the right decision by coming to  Terra Nova as everyone is busy moving  their belongings they notice that Zoe  has wandered off outside a curious Zoe  approaches a brachiosaur a dinosaur  species and feeds it with some Fern  surprisingly the giant herbivore accepts  it which makes the little girl very  happy the following day Josh and Maddie  head towards an orientation meeting  where they meet a fellow resident Sky  enter friends Tasha Max and Hunter after  the introductions Josh decides to  explore Terra Nova with Skye while  Maddie prefers to learn about their new  home by attending the orientation  meeting shortly after Skye and her  friends take Josh into the jungle they  arrive at a beautiful waterfall and jump  into it near the waterfall Sky shows  Josh some rocks wear golden colored  symbols are carved into them since  Taylor has forbidden anyone to visit  this area Sky makes Josh promise to keep  the stones a secret elsewhere in the  medical sector Elizabeth attends to a  patient surrounded by officers she  wonders why the patient needs security  and one of the officers informs her that  he is a Sixers member Sixers appear to  be a group of rebels who have separated  themselves from Terra Nova their main  goal is to overthrow Commander Taylor  and Rob the main colony of all its  resources suddenly the patient jumps  from his bed and threatens to kill  Elizabeth with a laser knife after using  her as a hostage and forcing the  officers to disarm the man flees outside  Jim notices the man acting suspicious  and follows him soon enough the man  attempts to attack Taylor but Jim  successfully stops him Jim knows that  there is more than a mere Paradise in  Terra Nova so he demands Taylor explain  about the man and why he was trying to  kill him however with everyone around  the latter insists Jim get in his  vehicle for a ride after the two reach  the same waterfall from before Taylor  starts explaining about the Sixers he  reveals that the Sixers came from the  sixth pilgrimage with a secret supply of  weapons however he doesn't know why the  group wants to overthrow him Taylor then  commends Jim on his bravery and offers  him to join Terra Nova's Security Forces  as the two continue chatting they notice  a group of Sixers heading toward their  colony wasting no time they begin  pursuing the Sixers But realize that  they are actually fleeing from two  Carnotaurus a species of carnivorous  dinosaurs Taylor and his group somehow  managed to repel the dinosaurs but they  still have to deal with their Arch  enemies Mira the leader of the Sixers  comes out of her vehicle along with the  others and starts talking she reveals  that she is there to negotiate the  release of Carter the same guy who tried  to kill Taylor earlier she then brings  forth a large box of meteoric iron an  extremely rare element and proposes to  trade it for Carter realizing that the  element is too valuable to give up on  Taylor agrees to the terms and releases  Carter elsewhere in the jungle Josh sky  and the other friends start making booze  from Wild fruits while they are enjoying  themselves they hear a loud roar Sky  explains it's an axoraptor otherwise  known as the slasher it is a dinosaur  species with colorful feathers and a  whip-like bladed tail capable of cutting  a man in half but she assures Josh not  to fear as slashers mostly hunt at night  mostly suddenly they hear an even louder  howl so they decide to return to their  vehicle however they are seen spotted by  a couple of deadly slashers the group  somehow manages to take refuge in an  armored vehicle abandoned by the Sixers  but by this time several slashers have  surrounded them in the attack Tasha Max  and Hunter get seriously injured back in  the colony Terra Nova security finds  footage of the teenagers sneaking away  fearing the worst Jim Elizabeth and some  soldiers head to the forest to rescue  the children fortunately they find the  group in the neck of time and scare away  the dinosaurs using some Advanced  Machinery following the close call they  head back to Terra Nova later Sky visits  Taylor and his residence and apologizes  for initiating the trip during their  conversation we realized that sky is an  orphan whose dads served under Taylor  both of her parents were taken away by  fever some years back imagine living  with dinosaurs and getting killed by a  fever one day a group of Terra Nova  soldiers goes out into the woods to get  some supplies however they are attacked  and brutally killed by some unseen  creatures in the meantime Josh Maddie  and Zoe attend a survival seminar taught  by Lieutenant Alicia Washington the  second in command to Taylor Maddie is a  smart kid and she eagerly answers most  of the questions asked by the lieutenant  later that night when Jim and Elizabeth  start getting intimate a creature starts  screaming so Jim goes outside to inspect  it is the same unseen animal that  attacked the soldiers earlier but Jim  doesn't know this so he simply scares it  away the following day Taylor and Jim  plan to search for the missing man  thinking it was the Sixers that attacked  them meanwhile Elizabeth is working in  the medical sector when she bumps into  Malcolm Wallace one of her good friends  from college Malcolm tells her that he  is a science officer there that sounds  made up Malcolm just then Jim walks in  and interrupts their conversation  Elizabeth quickly introduces the two to  each other but when Malcolm learns that  Jim is her husband he is taken aback in  the next scene Jim along with Taylor and  the crew head out to the woods while  driving Taylor asks Jim to investigate  who is giving Mira information about  Terra Nova he believes that there's a  mole within the colony the group then  arrives at the murder spot when they see  the dead soldiers they notice that their  faces have been disfigured after a bit  of checking around they bring the dead  bodies back to Terra Nova and the  medical team led by Elizabeth and  Malcolm starts examining them Elizabeth  deduces that the soldiers were attacked  from above just then Jim who is also in  the lab notices a claw-like piece on one  of the corpses with this clue the  medical officers decide to stay late to  find out what creature could have killed  the man however even after hours of  research they don't find any specimen  that matches the mysterious claw when  Elizabeth returns home Jim asks her  about Malcolm after he presses the issue  she finally tells him that she dated  Malcolm for a while before breaking it  off herself probably after learning that  there's no such thing as a science  officer later that night the couple  attempts intimacy once again but to  their bad luck they are again  interrupted by the same creature this  thing is dangerous and a pervert this  time Josh joins his father outside and  they notice several of the same  creatures there Josh tries scaring them  away with a rock but only ends up making  them angry they swarm over the  father-son duo like a deadly rash but  before any Serious injury is caused Josh  and Jim make it inside the house the  next day Malcolm examines Jim's injuries  from the creatures and realizes that  they're the same ones that killed the  man after treating the injuries a  curious gem asks Taylor about Malcolm  and learns that he was the one who  requested Elizabeth's Survival on Terra  Nova outside Skye and Josh are roaming  around the market when they notice a  large flock of the same Birds but before  they could warn the others the birds  start attacking everyone they leave the  place after a few minutes but by this  time several residents are seriously  injured meanwhile Malcolm recovers one  of the dead birds and concludes that  they are an unknown type of pterosaur a  species of flying reptile in a meeting  with Taylor and his crew Malcolm deduces  that the pterosaurs may be migrating  Taylor reveals that years ago he and  Lieutenant Alicia had discovered  thousands of eggshells while digging the  ground on which Terra Nova sits today  but since they were already hatched the  officers thought the creatures had long  since moved on Additionally the shells  made the ground so fertile that they  decided to make the settlement in this  location hearing this Malcolm concludes  that the pterosaurs are attacking them  because Terra Nova sits upon their  breeding rounds since the medical  officers do not know much about the new  species Malcolm and Elizabeth tell  Taylor that they will need a live male  and female specimen of the pterosaurs to  try to come up with a solution to defend  against them next Jim prepares to head  out of the colony to get the specimens  while Malcolm details him about the  species however instead of listening Jim  confronts him for still being in love  with his wife as he was the one who  requested her presence in Terra Nova  this shocks Malcolm and he defends  himself by saying that he called  Elizabeth as she is the best medical  officer he has ever known a while later  Jim returns with the two sad specimens  after studying the creatures Malcolm and  Elizabeth discover that they can produce  an extremely powerful pheromone that  could be used to lure all of the  pterosaurs away from the colony and to  another location where they can breed as  more pterosaurs continue to arrive at  the settlement Taylor orders the  security team members to be stationed  All Around The Colony Mark Reynolds a  young soldier who evidently has a crush  on Maddie comes to her home for security  on the other hand also brings Sky to  keep her safe from the creatures soon  after a giant swarm of pterosaurs  invades the settlement and starts  wreaking havoc a few of them forced  their way into Jim's house via the air  duct Mark being a soldier tries to scare  them away but only ends up getting his  ass knocked out despite this Josh and  the group fight valiantly and hold off  the creatures long enough to lock  themselves in another room elsewhere at  the medical lab Elizabeth and Malcolm  finally finished preparing the  pheromones now all they have to do is  lure the pterosaurs away the commander  Taylor decides to volunteer and Jim also  joins him soon the two gear up and leave  in a vehicle which starts spraying the  pheromone surprisingly the plan works  and despite Taylor and Jim receiving  some minor Cuts they managed to lure the  entire swarm of pterosaurs away from  Terra Nova the episode ends as all the  residents come out of their homes and  resume their normal lives again to know  what happens to them next watch the  second part in our new channel series  recapped
 

